### star word star glob
[[ $name =~ *log* ]] && echo "log"
>>> SC2049 1:13
>>> SC2154 1:4

### letter followed by a star
[[ $name =~ a* ]] && echo "a"
>>> SC2049 1:13
>>> SC2154 1:4

### variable on the right is fine
[[ $name =~ $regex ]] && echo "match"
>>> SC2154 1:13
>>> SC2154 1:4

### anchored dot star is fine
[[ $name =~ ^build.* ]] && echo "build"
>>> SC2154 1:4

### escaped star is fine
[[ $name =~ \* ]] && echo "star"
>>> SC2154 1:4

### group with a star is fine
[[ $name =~ (ab)* ]] && echo "ab"
>>> SC2154 1:4

### escaped star followed by letters is fine
[[ $name =~ \*tmp ]] && echo "tmp"
>>> SC2154 1:4

### letter followed by an escaped star is fine
[[ $name =~ x\* ]] && echo "x"
>>> SC2154 1:4
